13:56:07.401 | Nearing a river. (road)
13:56:07.407 | Nature's fecundity floods the surrounds with the clamour of life in a chittering refrain. Dawn breaks across the land, the sky and its sparse clouds lit in fiery hues by the rising sun. The large trees of the Northern Ithmia sway gently in the breeze far to the northeast, while to the southwest the clear waters of the Zaphar river slice its way through the almost impenetrable forest. Crossing the river is a rickety wooden bridge that is in obvious need of repair. From this vantage point, you doubt that the bridge will hold your weight. The opaque form of a phantom harp seal drifts here. A daemonic hyena awaits in savage readiness, her cold eyes burning with cunning malevolence amidst the steady exhalation of crimson fog from slavering jaws. Tyndran Tabethys Aristata, Tyrannical Butcher of Baelgrim is here. She wields an exquisite Mhaldorian staff of sterling silver in her left hand and a Shield of Absorption in her right. Steward Layta Lichlord, Red Reaper is here, hidden. Her features are obscured by an unsettling porcelain doll-face mask. She wields Agith'maal's ire in her left hand and a bone shield reinforced with blackened steel in her right. Eradicator Maldrantus is here, hidden. His features are obscured by a mask of lifevision. He wields a Shield of Absorption in his left hand and Agith'maal's ire in his right. Warden Sinit d'Ivoire is here. Valkyri, Seeker of Elocution is here. She wields a flail in each hand. The soul of Jakiro roams the land, bodiless. Na'vroth Pharaus Lichlord is riding on a phantom harp seal. His features are obscured by a mask of lifevision beneath the raised hood of a Hood of the Sphinx. He wields a daemon-forged scimitar bound in dark chains in his left hand and a chain-wreathed scimitar with a daemonic guard in his right.
13:56:07.412 | You see exits leading northeast, southeast, and southwest.
