13:57:09.387 | Nature's fecundity floods the surrounds with the clamour of life in a chittering refrain. This area is unnaturally flooded with water. Dawn breaks across the land, the sky and its sparse clouds lit in fiery hues by the rising sun. At this point, the road is scarred with many pot holes. You nearly twist your ankle as you try to manoeuvre your way along. To the northeast and southwards, the road stumbles along toward unknown destinations. A large, two-headed hellhound stands guard here, both his heads growling and snapping occasionally. There is a small group of green inks here. There are 9 blue inks in a group here. There is a small group of yellow inks here. There are 7 red inks in a group here. There are 5 purple inks in a group here. The opaque form of a phantom harp seal drifts here. A daemonic hyena awaits in savage readiness, her cold eyes burning with cunning malevolence amidst the steady exhalation of crimson fog from slavering jaws. Hands of rotting flesh and white bone push up from the ground. Steward Layta Lichlord, Red Reaper is here, hidden. Her features are obscured by an unsettling porcelain doll-face mask. She wields Agith'maal's ire in her left hand and a bone shield reinforced with blackened steel in her right. Warden Sinit d'Ivoire is here. Na'vroth Pharaus Lichlord is riding on a phantom harp seal. His features are obscured by a mask of lifevision beneath the raised hood of a Hood of the Sphinx. He wields a daemon-forged scimitar bound in dark chains in his left hand and a chain-wreathed scimitar with a daemonic guard in his right.
