13:57:28.933 | At the northern fringe of the forest.
13:57:28.941 | Nature's fecundity floods the surrounds with the clamour of life in a chittering refrain. Vines have overtaken this location. Dawn rises upon a cloudless sky, the dim, reddish rays of the sun shining down upon the land. The impenetrable expanse of the Ithmia sits majestically at the borders of the northern plains, casting shadows that stretch out over the grasses like portents of impending doom. The gloomy interior of the forest is enveloped in an oppressive haze of dust-laden darkness, concealing a maze of protruding stones and exposed roots that make the ground treacherous and uncertain for travellers. A trickling burble of water indicates the presence of a small stream nearby, the tangled undergrowth growing thickly enough to obscure the rivulet from view. A massive creature of rock and earth sits immobile as a stone. A phantom spider lurks in the shadows, the outline of its hulking frame scarcely discernible. An icewall is here, blocking passage to the south. A daemonic hyena awaits in savage readiness, her cold eyes burning with cunning malevolence amidst the steady exhalation of crimson fog from slavering jaws. The opaque form of a phantom harp seal drifts here. An unnatural darkness cloaks the location. Tyndran Tabethys Aristata, Tyrannical Butcher of Baelgrim is riding on a hulking phantom spider. She wields an exquisite Mhaldorian staff of sterling silver in her left hand and a Shield of Absorption in her right. Steward Layta Lichlord, Red Reaper is here, hidden. Her features are obscured by an unsettling porcelain doll-face mask. She wields Agith'maal's ire in her left hand and a bone shield reinforced with blackened steel in her right. Eradicator Maldrantus is here, hidden. His features are obscured by a mask of lifevision. He wields a Shield of Absorption in his left hand and Agith'maal's ire in his right. Warden Sinit d'Ivoire is here. Valkyri, Seeker of Elocution is here. She wields a flail in each hand. Na'vroth Pharaus Lichlord is riding on a phantom harp seal. His features are obscured by a mask of lifevision beneath the raised hood of a Hood of the Sphinx. He wields a daemon-forged scimitar bound in dark chains in his left hand and a chain-wreathed scimitar with a daemonic guard in his right. The Red Dragon Zaphael's imposing form looms.
