13:58:30.369 | Nature's fecundity floods the surrounds with the clamour of life in a chittering refrain. Vines have overtaken this location. This area is unnaturally flooded with water. Dawn rises upon a cloudless sky, the dim, reddish rays of the sun shining down upon the land. Here in the depths of the woodland, the Northern Ithmia is bereft of the natural beauty one would normally associate with the forests. The densely packed trees, rather than displaying the green foliage one might expect, are blackened and sooty, their branches twisted like the limbs of a horribly crippled beast. Dark faces leer from the slimy, moss-covered trunks, their knots glaring outwards like cataract-covered eyes. Despite such a dismal scene in all directions, several of the trees bear new leaves, and young shoots are visible in the blackened undergrowth. A young, healthy sapling thrives here bravely. An elegant white letter is in danger of being soiled here. The opaque form of a phantom harp seal drifts here. A daemonic hyena awaits in savage readiness, her cold eyes burning with cunning malevolence amidst the steady exhalation of crimson fog from slavering jaws. A massive creature of rock and earth sits immobile as a stone. A phantom spider lurks in the shadows, the outline of its hulking frame scarcely discernible. An unnatural darkness cloaks the location. Tyndran Tabethys Aristata, Tyrannical Butcher of Baelgrim is riding on a hulking phantom spider. She wields an exquisite Mhaldorian staff of sterling silver in her left hand and a Shield of Absorption in her right. Steward Layta Lichlord, Red Reaper is here, hidden. Her features are obscured by an unsettling porcelain doll-face mask. She wields Agith'maal's ire in her left hand and a bone shield reinforced with blackened steel in her right. Eradicator Maldrantus is here, hidden. His features are obscured by a mask of lifevision. He wields a Shield of Absorption in his left hand and Agith'maal's ire in his right. Warden Sinit d'Ivoire is here. Valkyri, Seeker of Elocution is here. She wields a flail in each hand. Na'vroth Pharaus Lichlord is riding on a phantom harp seal. His features are obscured by a mask of lifevision beneath the raised hood of a Hood of the Sphinx. He wields a daemon-forged scimitar bound in dark chains in his left hand and a chain-wreathed scimitar with a daemonic guard in his right. The Red Dragon Zaphael's imposing form looms.
