13:59:03.689 | Nature's fecundity floods the surrounds with the clamour of life in a chittering refrain. Vines have overtaken this location. Dawn rises upon a cloudless sky, the dim, reddish rays of the sun shining down upon the land. Fragrant mint grows in a hollow along the eastern bank of the great river Zaphar, the lifeblood of the forests of central Sapience. The river has not yet reached its full might at this point; here it could be forded by a tall man with ease. The waters flow slowly through the level ground of the forest, ushering slowly past the solemn, morose trees who on occasion droop their mossy brows into the refreshing waters, tainting them with their own foul rancour. An enigmatic black lamassu stands here, her tail lashing the air silently. A large cart rests here, stacked high with assorted containers secured with thick rope. The opaque form of a phantom harp seal drifts here. A daemonic hyena awaits in savage readiness, her cold eyes burning with cunning malevolence amidst the steady exhalation of crimson fog from slavering jaws. A massive creature of rock and earth sits immobile as a stone. A phantom spider lurks in the shadows, the outline of its hulking frame scarcely discernible. Tyndran Tabethys Aristata, Tyrannical Butcher of Baelgrim is riding on a hulking phantom spider. She wields a Shield of Absorption in her left hand and an exquisite Mhaldorian staff of sterling silver in her right. Steward Layta Lichlord, Red Reaper is here, hidden. Her features are obscured by an unsettling porcelain doll-face mask. She wields Agith'maal's ire in her left hand and a bone shield reinforced with blackened steel in her right. Eradicator Maldrantus is here, hidden. His features are obscured by a mask of lifevision. He wields a Shield of Absorption in his left hand and Agith'maal's ire in his right. Warden Sinit d'Ivoire is here. Valkyri, Seeker of Elocution is here. She wields a flail in each hand. Na'vroth Pharaus Lichlord is riding on a phantom harp seal. His features are obscured by a mask of lifevision beneath the raised hood of a Hood of the Sphinx. He wields a daemon-forged scimitar bound in dark chains in his left hand and a chain-wreathed scimitar with a daemonic guard in his right. The Red Dragon Zaphael's imposing form looms.
