14:11:03.037 P H: Full, M: High, E: High, W: Full cexkdb-
14:11:03.116 | Wasteland. (road)
14:11:03.123 | A noxious, red-hued fog overwhelms the area with a thick, palpable vapour. The sun shines down, its rays broken only by the occasional wisp of cloud. Listless breezes swirl lazily across the bleak landscape, generated from within the depths of an arid dust bowl and lifting up sweeping clouds of dust in its wake. Uncomfortably rough, dry grit manages to break free from the calm wind, blowing hazardously into the eyes of travellers. The barren land is broken by fractures and large, twisted spires of rock, gazing devoutly towards the maliciously red-tinted sky. Bones litter the dusty earth across a minuscule path, skulls glaring with dark, chipped eye sockets towards the west. An occupied iron gibbet, suspended from a wooden gallows, creaks ominously in the breeze. A large cart rests here, stacked high with assorted containers secured with thick rope. Crimson eyes burn ardently beneath the black crown of feathers encircling the head of a giant nycticorax. A daemonic hyena awaits in savage readiness, her cold eyes burning with cunning malevolence amidst the steady exhalation of crimson fog from slavering jaws. A phantom spider lurks in the shadows, the outline of its hulking frame scarcely discernible. Tyndran Tabethys Aristata, Tyrannical Butcher of Baelgrim is riding on a hulking phantom spider. She wields an exquisite Mhaldorian staff of sterling silver in her left hand and a Shield of Absorption in her right. Steward Layta Lichlord, Red Reaper is here, hidden. Her features are obscured by an unsettling porcelain doll-face mask. She wields Agith'maal's ire in her left hand and a bone shield reinforced with blackened steel in her right. Eradicator Maldrantus is here, hidden. His features are obscured by a mask of lifevision. He wields a Shield of Absorption in his left hand and Agith'maal's ire in his right. Warden Sinit d'Ivoire is here. Valkyri, Seeker of Elocution is here. She wields a flail in each hand. The Red Dragon Zaphael's imposing form looms.
14:11:03.127 | You see exits leading southeast and west.
